Package: budget-planner
Version: 3.20.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 22), poppler-utils, tesseract-ocr
Recommends: systemd
Maintainer: HamidrezaTg <hamidreza@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Self-hosted multi-user budget planner
 Private, local-first household budgeting: statement import with duplicate
 protection, learning categorization, budgets with rollover, sinking funds,
 96-month projection, multi-currency reporting, month-end report snapshots,
 attachments, and an installable PWA frontend. Data stays on this machine.
